contentText:
Kid Cudi &#8216;s reunion on stage with Kanye West in Chicago &#8212; which marked the pair&#8217;s first live performance together in years &#8212; was celebrated by many hip-hop fans, but not everyone was thrilled by the enthusiasm for Ye.

